sms.body:
Book by 11DEC & Save 6L Enjoy 9 beaches
@ANJARLE Seaside plots at TomorroWorld-NO SDR/GST
EMI @8,999PM House of Abhinandan LODHA CL 9152065985 WEBSITE t.ly/M075

Avoid standing in queue. Go for Safe, easy & free online payment;
visit mahadiscom.in & get discount 0.25%(Max Rs.500)
helpline helpdesk_pg@mahadiscom.in

